# Slice 283 probe: a sub called through a callable place, the declared one and a rebound one, with the catch that names what stops it.  Entry 7.
Callables:
    sub: s ()
        int: w 4
        w: w + 1
    end: s
end: Callables
sub: other_sub ()
    int: pad 8
    int: w 9
    w: w + 1
end: other_sub
int: code 7
---
    Callables\s()
    catch: interpreter ()
        code: 21
---
@: Callables\s other_sub
---
    Callables\s()
    catch: interpreter ()
        code: 22
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
